\pard\b\fs20 Griffon Battle\b0\par
\fs16\par
The annual griffon battle was once a contest that decided the ranking of the paladins in the Order of Sawel\'f4. But over time the paladins of the Legion of Teiwaz found out where the battle took place, too, and began to join in. And so this once so important contest lost its importance and became an event purely for fun.\par
